{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37733","headline":"少华甘露寺 · 郑谷","name":"少华甘露寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"石门萝径与天邻，雨桧风篁远近闻。\n饮涧鹿喧双派水，上楼僧蹋一梯云。\n孤烟薄暮关城没，远色初晴渭曲分。\n长欲然香来此宿，北林猨鹤旧同羣。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37733.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37733","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}